SUMMARY:This Is Not Goodbye
LOCATION:Maison poème\, Rue d'Écosse 30\, 1060 Saint-Gilles
URL:https://maisonpoeme.be/
DESCRIPTION:A polyphonic concert to tell the story of loss\, to say or re
 say goodbye\, to shed tears or share knowing smiles with those who have 
 passed. These polyphonic songs are created based on intimate experiences
  and life encounters. We sing in three-part harmony\, a cappella\, in Fr
 ench and English [...]\nhttps://maisonpoeme.be/
CATEGORIES:Maison Poème\,Other\,Evening
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT120M
DESCRIPTION:This Is Not Goodbye
