SUMMARY:Letters on Enthusiasm — Launch Evening
LOCATION:Maison poème\, Rue d'Écosse 30\, 1060 Saint-Gilles
URL:https://maisonpoeme.be/
DESCRIPTION:With everything collapsing around us\, how can we stay enthus
 iastic? How do we move forward? Is it possible to sustain enthusiasm? To
  lose it entirely? Or perhaps to embrace collective enthusiasm together?
  That's the idea behind this book: inviting 26 women writers to share th
 eir relationship with enthusiasm through letters [...]\nhttps://maisonpo
 eme.be/
CATEGORIES:Maison Poème\,Other\,Evening
