DESCRIPTION:Who is Sylvie Savon? She's the kind of woman who messes every
 thing up\, but with grace. Arrogant\, free\, lost and funny in spite of 
 herself\, she's our heroine—a real-life hero of resourcefulness and un
 certain tomorrows. No career\, no family\, no pension plan—just an apa
 rtment plan [...]\nhttps://maisonpoeme.be/
